WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.864
Profiles: ready-made sets of settings. Open the Profile list at the top of the panel.

00:00:03.964 --> 00:00:11.318
The built-in profiles cover common jobs: book scans, phone photos, archive copies, and more.

00:00:11.418 --> 00:00:19.744
Choosing one applies all its settings at once.

00:00:19.844 --> 00:00:28.672
Undo and Redo at the top of the panel step back and forth through such changes.

00:00:28.772 --> 00:00:36.524
Your own profile: set things the way you like, type a name and press Save profile.

00:00:36.624 --> 00:00:43.055
The saved profile now appears in the list and can be applied any time.
